OL,3,GNEWSAYoung racer with diabetes wants to
OL,4,Ainspire, dad says
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenager with type 1 diabetes is
OL,7,Fhoping to inspire others with the
OL,8,Fcondition as he moves from simulator
OL,9,Fracing to real cars, his father has
OL,10,Fsaid.
OL,12,FZachary Houghton, from Redhill in
OL,13,FSurrey, completed his first Formula
OL,14,FFord race at the end of August, driving
OL,15,Fa racing car on a circuit for the first
OL,16,Ftime.
OL,18,FThe 17-year-old told BBC Radio Surrey:
OL,19,F"I reckon I'll be able to get back in
OL,20,Fthe car again - it will just be [about]
OL,21,Ffinding the funding because motorsport
OL,22,Fisn't cheap."
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
