OL,3,GNEWSAYoung racer with diabetes wants to
OL,4,Ainspire, dad says
OL,5,
OL,6,FHis father, Scott Houghton, said his
OL,7,Fson wanted "to be an advocate and an
OL,8,Finspiration" to those with the
OL,9,Fcondition.
